      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.25,
          "end": 3.73,
          "en": "Now, for that attached,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.73,
          "end": 6.05,
          "en": "you find the application we built",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.05,
          "end": 8.44,
          "en": "in the last course section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.44,
          "end": 10.84,
          "en": "However, with one difference.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.84,
          "end": 13.75,
          "en": "There is a new frontend-app folder in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.75,
          "end": 17.52,
          "en": "and, in there, you find a basic React application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.52,
          "end": 21.53,
          "en": "which will be ready to talk to our Deno server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.53,
          "end": 25.16,
          "en": "Now, I'm not writing this application from scratch with you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.16,
          "end": 27.38,
          "en": "because this course is not about React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.38,
          "end": 29.1,
          "en": "It's about node in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.1,
          "end": 32.28,
          "en": "and now also about Deno, I guess.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.28,
          "end": 34.81,
          "en": "Therefore, you get this finished application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.81,
          "end": 37.31,
          "en": "and in order to start and use it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.31,
          "end": 39.78,
          "en": "make sure that you open up a terminal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.78,
          "end": 42.51,
          "en": "navigate it into this extracted folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.51,
          "end": 43.81,
          "en": "which you find attached,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.81,
          "end": 47.41,
          "en": "and then cd into the frontend-app folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.41,
          "end": 48.71,
          "en": "So, with this cd command,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.71,
          "end": 50.98,
          "en": "move into that frontend-app folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 50.98,
          "end": 53.87,
          "en": "And, in there, first of all, run npm install",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 53.87,
          "end": 57.52,
          "en": "to install all the dependencies of this provided project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 57.52,
          "end": 60.89,
          "en": "This will then generate this node_modules folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 60.89,
          "end": 63.14,
          "en": "in the frontend-app folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 63.14,
          "end": 65.1,
          "en": "Thereafter, run npm start,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 65.1,
          "end": 68.31,
          "en": "and this will now spin up a simple development server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 68.31,
          "end": 71.61,
          "en": "for this front-end application, and that's important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 71.61,
          "end": 74.17,
          "en": "This will now not start our Deno server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 74.17,
          "end": 78.01,
          "en": "it will start a standalone development-only server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 78.01,
          "end": 80.28,
          "en": "for this front-end application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 80.28,
          "end": 82.95,
          "en": "It's essentially the same pattern we used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 82.95,
          "end": 87.31,
          "en": "in the REST API and GraphQL modules of this course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 87.31,
          "end": 88.98,
          "en": "if you remember that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 88.98,
          "end": 92.44,
          "en": "Now, this should automatically open up a new tab",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 92.44,
          "end": 94.66,
          "en": "on localhost:3000.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 94.66,
          "end": 97.22,
          "en": "If it didn't, you can simply do it manually.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 97.22,
          "end": 100.06,
          "en": "And here, you got this React application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 100.06,
          "end": 103.66,
          "en": "which will try to communicate to our Deno server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 103.66,
          "end": 105.28,
          "en": "Though, of course, at the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 105.28,
          "end": 108.33,
          "en": "at least for me, this server is not up and running,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 108.33,
          "end": 111.34,
          "en": "and, therefore, if we open up the developer tools,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 111.34,
          "end": 114.49000000000001,
          "en": "we see that we got an error being printed here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 114.49000000000001,
          "end": 118.12,
          "en": "We're not able to get results from the server, essentially,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 118.12,
          "end": 121.73,
          "en": "and therefore we're not able to render any todos here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 121.73,
          "end": 125.18,
          "en": "Well, that is something we can fix, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 125.18,
          "end": 127.89,
          "en": "Keep that development React server running,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 127.89,
          "end": 129.73,
          "en": "and open a new terminal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 129.73,
          "end": 132.85,
          "en": "so that you got that other process still running,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 132.85,
          "end": 135.65,
          "en": "and now, in your main project folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 135.65,
          "end": 137.82,
          "en": "so now longer in frontend-app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 137.82,
          "end": 140,
          "en": "but in your main project folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 140,
          "end": 141.59,
          "en": "run your Deno app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 141.59,
          "end": 144.21,
          "en": "For that, I'll cd into the deno folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 144.21,
          "end": 148.72,
          "en": "and then, with deno run --allow-net,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 148.72,
          "end": 151.95,
          "en": "I can run the app.ts file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 151.95,
          "end": 154.86,
          "en": "Now, this will spin up the Deno server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 154.86,
          "end": 157.74,
          "en": "but now I get a address in use error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 157.74,
          "end": 161.41,
          "en": "And the reason for that is that our Deno application here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 161.41,
          "end": 164.29,
          "en": "also wants to run on port 3000,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 164.29,
          "end": 167.95,
          "en": "and that's where the React app runs already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 167.95,
          "end": 169.45,
          "en": "The fix is simple.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 169.45,
          "end": 171.95,
          "en": "I'll switch Deno to port 8000,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 171.95,
          "end": 174.17000000000002,
          "en": "that's also a common development port,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 174.17000000000002,
          "end": 176.4,
          "en": "and therefore now, if we rerun this command,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 176.4,
          "end": 179.253,
          "en": "it should compile and run this successfully.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 180.16,
          "end": 182.48,
          "en": "If you now reload the application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 182.48,
          "end": 185.58,
          "en": "you still get that error though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 185.58,
          "end": 188.94,
          "en": "Now, the reason for that is that in the React application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 188.94,
          "end": 191.18,
          "en": "we need to make one tiny adjustment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 191.18,
          "end": 194.32,
          "en": "and, for that, you don't need to know React, no worries.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 194.32,
          "end": 196.5,
          "en": "In the frontend-app source folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 196.5,
          "end": 201.29,
          "en": "under components, Todos.js, you'll find a bunch of URLs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 201.29,
          "end": 205.24,
          "en": "and they always point at localhost:3000.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 205.24,
          "end": 207.17000000000002,
          "en": "Change this to 8000 now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 207.17000000000002,
          "end": 209.93,
          "en": "because that's where our server is running on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 209.93,
          "end": 212.113,
          "en": "So, change all those occurrences,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 213.06,
          "end": 215.53,
          "en": "and save that Todos.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 215.53,
          "end": 218.78,
          "en": "This will now restart the React server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 218.78,
          "end": 221.38,
          "en": "and you now can already see the Middleware log",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 221.38,
          "end": 224.47,
          "en": "at the bottom here, which means that a request reached",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 224.47,
          "end": 226.42000000000002,
          "en": "our Deno server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 226.42000000000002,
          "end": 229.72,
          "en": "And indeed it did, but now we're getting a different error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 229.72,
          "end": 231.66,
          "en": "We're getting a CORS error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 231.66,
          "end": 235.38,
          "en": "And to fix that, we need to understand what CORS is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 235.38,
          "end": 237.71,
          "en": "I did cover it before in the course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 237.71,
          "end": 240.17,
          "en": "I'll give you a brief refresher here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 240.17,
          "end": 241.97,
          "en": "And, once we understood that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 241.97,
          "end": 244.723,
          "en": "we can fix it in our Deno application code.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
